sequenceDiagram
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Outbox
    participant Pod1 as Relay Pod 1
    participant Pod2 as Relay Pod 2
    participant Pod3 as Relay Pod 3
    
    Note over DB: 500 New Events Arrive
    
    par Concurrent Polling
        Pod1->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED LIMIT 100
        Pod2->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED LIMIT 100
        Pod3->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED LIMIT 100
    end
    
    DB-->>Pod1: Returns Rows 1-100 (Locks them)
    DB-->>Pod2: Skips 1-100, Returns Rows 101-200
    DB-->>Pod3: Skips 1-200, Returns Rows 201-300
    
    Note over Pod1,Pod3: Zero overlap. Zero deadlocks.<br/>100% throughput utilization.
